Error: Jet.ComptimeEndedBySignal: Compile-time code was ended by SIGKILL from outside jet
  --> Tests/UI/comptime_ended_by_an_outside_signal.jet:16:38
    |
 16 | #StepLimit(4000000000) FOREVER: #run spin()
    |                                      ^^^^
 Why: Jet runs compile-time code in a process of its own, and another process or the system (as when memory runs out) sent that process SIGKILL, so the code never finished; jet and the program did not raise it
 Fix: Build again without stopping it; if the system ended it because memory ran out, free memory or make the compile-time work smaller
